<body lang=EN-US style='word-wrap:break-word'>

<div class=WordSection1>

<div style='border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 4.5pt;padding:0in 0in 3.0pt 0in;
margin-left:.5in;margin-right:13.5pt'>

<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center;border:none;
padding:0in'><b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>DISPOSITION OF FORMER K.C.C. SECTIONS</span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='border:none;padding:0in'><span style='font-family:
"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center;border:none;
padding:0in'><b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>UPDATED: </span></b> <b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>September 9, 2026</span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;border:none;padding:0in'><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

</div>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'><b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></b></p>

<div style='border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 4.5pt;padding:0in 0in 3.0pt 0in;
margin-left:.5in;margin-right:13.5pt'>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;border:none;padding:0in'><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>This table contains
a numerical list of K.C.C. sections no longer appearing in the code because of
the repeal, expiration, decodification, or recodification of the sections. 
Each entry gives the affected K.C.C. number, its caption, and the section's ordinance
source and disposition.  The text of the section can be found by referring to
the ordinance source citation contained in brackets.</span></p>

</div>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:center'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>TITLE 1</span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:center'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>COUNTY COUNCIL AND
ELECTIONS</span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:center'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>Chapter 1.05 
Limits on Campaign Contributions</span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1.05.050—Campaign contract.</span></b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>—[8970 § 6, 1989]. Repealed by 10632 §
4, 1992.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1.05.060—Candidates' contribution limit.</span></b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>—[8970 § 7, 1989].  Repealed by 10632 §
4, 1992.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1.05.070—Expenditure limitations.</span></b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>—[8970 § 8, 1989].  Repealed by 10632 §
4, 1992.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1.05.080—Eligibility for public matching
funds.</span></b><span style='font-family:Symbol'>¾</span><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>[8970 § 9, 1989].  Repealed by 10632 §
4, 1992.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1.05.090—Public matching funds —
specifications.—</span></b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>[8970 §
10, 1989].  Repealed by 10632 § 4, 1992.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1.05.100—Payment of matching funds.</span></b><b><span
style='font-family:Symbol'>¾</span></b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>[8970
§ 11, 1989].  Repealed by 10632 § 4, 1992.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1.05.110—Permitted uses of public
matching funds.—</span></b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>[8970 §
12, 1989].  Repealed by 10632 § 4, 1992.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1.05.140—Severability.—</span></b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>[13489 § 9, 1994].  Decodified in
accordance with K.C.C. 1.03.030, 2009.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:center'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Chapter 1.08  Election Officers and
Polling Places</span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:center'><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>(see also 1.12)</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'><b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>&nbsp;</span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'><b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1.08.010—Precinct
election officials - Compensation.</span></b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>—[918
§ 1, 1971].  Repealed by 12713 </span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'><b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1.08.020—Inspectors,
judges and clerks - Compensation.</span></b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>—[918
§ 2, 1971].  Repealed by 9391, 1990.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'><b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1.08.020—Inspectors
and judges - Compensation.</span></b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>—[9391
§ 1, 1990].  Repealed by 16557 </span><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>§</span><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'> 4,
2009.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'><b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1.08.030—Rental
for polling places.</span></b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>—[918
§ 3, 1971].  Repealed by 16557 </span><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>§</span><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'> 4,
2009.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:center'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Chapter 1.10  Voters' Pamphlet</span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1.10.050—Interlocal agreements.</span></b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>—[8113 § 6, 1987].  Repealed by 19386 § 2,
2022.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:center'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Chapter 1.12  Election Officers and
Polling Places</span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1.12.010—Compensation authorized.</span></b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>—[Res. 23786 § 1, 1962].  Repealed by
918 § 4, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1.12.020—Pay zones for persons
delivering election supplies.</span></b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>—[Res.
