66, 67, 68, 70, 71, 72, 73, 81, 82, 83, 84, 85, 86, 87, 88, 89, 90, 92, 93, 95,
96, 97, 98, 99, 100, and 105 of this ordinance take effect within the shoreline
jurisdiction fourteen days after the state Department of Ecology provides
