letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.010—Definitions.</span></b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 §1, 1945]. </span><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Repealed by <span style='letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>1322 § 1, 1972.</span></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.020—Connection
with public sewer required - Exception.</span></b><span style='font-family:
"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 § 2, 1945].  </span><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Repealed by 1322 § 1, <span
style='letter-spacing:-.1pt'>1972.</span></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.030—Prohibition
