"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 § 2, 1945].  Repealed by 1322 §
1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.040—Notice to
