"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 § 5, 1945].  </span><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Repealed by 1322 § 1, <span
style='letter-spacing:-.1pt'>1972.</span></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.070—Information
required on application for permit - Road engineer issues public sewer sketch -
alteration of plan unlawful.</span></b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 § 6, 1945].  </span><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Repealed
by 1322 § 1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.080—Road
engineer keeps record of connections.</span></b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 § 6, 1945].  Repealed</span><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'> by 1322 § 1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.090—Issuance
and revocation of temporary permits - Assessment of costs.</span></b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 § 7, 1945]. 
</span><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Repealed by 1322 § 1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.100—Permit
