style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 § 17,
1945].  </span><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Repealed by 1322 §
1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.200—Inspection
of connecting sewer - Settling backfill.</span></b><span style='font-family:
"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 § 18, 1945].  Repealed</span><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'> by 1322 § 1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.210—Right of
