<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>13.04.220<span style='letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>—</span>Inspection fee - Delinquent payment - record of payment—</span></b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>[9817 <span style='letter-spacing:-.1pt'>§
20</span>, 1945].  Repealed by 1322 <span style='letter-spacing:-.1pt'>§ </span>1,
1972. </span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.230—County to
