style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 § 21,
1945].  </span><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Repealed by 1322 §
1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.240—County to
complete unfinished work - Assessment of costs.</span></b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 § 22,
1945].  </span><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Repealed by 1322 §
1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
