letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 § </span><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>24,
1945].  Repealed by 1322 § 1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.270—Obstruction
of sewers unlawful.</span></b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 § </span><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>25,
1945].  Repealed by 1322 § 1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.280—Temperature
of water discharged into sewer.</span></b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 § 26, 1945].  </span><span style='font-family:
"Arial",sans-serif'>Repealed by 1322 § 1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.290—Discharge
