style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 §27, </span><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1945].  Repealed by 1322 § 1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.300—Planting
of certain trees near sewers unlawful - Assessment of costs for removal of
