-.1pt'>—[9817 § 28, 1945]. </span><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'> Repealed
by 1322 § 1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.310—Authority
of county to construct or repair improper or damaged sewers - Assessment of
costs.</span></b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>—[9817 § 29, 1945].  </span><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Repealed
by 1322 § 1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.320—Authority
of sanitarian, road engineer and health officer to enforce chapter.</span></b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 § 30, 1945</span><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>].  Repealed by 1322 § 1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.330—Privilege
