style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 § 31,
1945].  </span><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Repealed by 1322 §
1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.340—Sewer
districts and commissions to submit plans to sanitarian or engineer.</span></b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 § 32, </span><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1945].  Repealed by 1322 § 1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.350—Collection
of money charged as a lien.</span></b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—</span><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>[9817
§ 33, 1945].  Repealed by 1322 § 1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.360—Violation
- Misdemeanor.</span></b><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 § 35, </span><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1945]. 
Repealed by 1322 § 1, 1972.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'><b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>13.04.370—Severability.</span></b><span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>—[9817 § 34,
1945].  Repealed</span><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'> by 1322 §
1, 1972.</span></p>

